@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
title Smart Campus - use cases (revised)

actor Student
actor Administrator

rectangle "Smart Campus Room Booking System" {
  usecase "View room availability" as UC1
  usecase "Book room" as UC2
  usecase "Cancel own booking" as UC3
  usecase "Block room" as UC4
  usecase "Unblock room" as UC5
  usecase "Review room usage" as UC6
}

Student --> UC1
Student --> UC2
Student --> UC3

Administrator --> UC4
Administrator --> UC5
Administrator --> UC6

note right of UC2
  US-02. Rules checked: R1, R3, R2.
  On success the system issues a
  confirmation (R4, US-04). The
  confirmation is a result of booking,
  not a goal.
end note

note right of UC3
  US-03. Only the student's own
  ACTIVE booking can be cancelled.
end note

note right of UC4
  US-05 (R3). Existing bookings
  of the room stay ACTIVE (A2).
end note

note right of UC6
  US-06. Booked hours per room;
  CANCELLED bookings not counted.
end note
@enduml
